cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use claude-blender in research, please cite it as below."
title: "claude-blender: Natural language to Blender via Claude"
abstract: >-
  Single-file Python CLI that turns natural language into runnable Blender
  (bpy) scripts via the Claude API, with optional live execution over the
  BlenderMCP socket. Includes an EvoSkillOps flywheel, a Space Metaverse
  demo catalog, and a full agent-detectable manifest surface
  (AGENTS.md, llms.txt, .well-known/agents.json).
authors:
